<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S.Trust estimate raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S.Trust estimate raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Brown Brothers Harriman said analyst Raphael Soifer raised his 1997 earnings estimate for U.S. Trust Corp to $4.20 per share from $4.10.</p>
<p>-- kept his 1996 estimate at $3.75 a share.</p>
<p>-- kept stock rated outperform/buy.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/4 to 61-1/4 on Thursday.</p>
</text>
